{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/67783-tower-of-babel-v-mage","id":67783,"title":"\"Tower of Babel\" v. Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-08T01:35:17-08:00","id":67783,"title":"\"Tower of Babel\" v. Mage","content":"I may be remembering this wrong, but when casting Mage's have a vocal componant to their spells. Would the &quot;Tower of Babel&quot; exploit stop the castinging (or at lead further castings) or perhaps weaken the spell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1991-fallenxanderel","name":"FallenXanderel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T01:58:25-08:00","id":67793,"title":"","content":"They can, optionally, <i>add</i> a verbal component to their spells for a couple of extra dice on the casting roll by extending the casting time. It is not in any way required.<br /> <br /> So no, it wouldn't do anything in most cases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1218,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1218-taejix","user":"Taejix","date":". 02-08-2014, 05:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1218-taejix","name":"Taejix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T07:09:06-08:00","id":67882,"title":"","content":"I don't know a whole lot about Mage, but Tower of Babel affects Human Languages, and I have this feeling that any sort of &quot;Atlantean High Speech&quot; is going to be unaffected by A&gt; being Supernal not Human, and B&gt; technically being a transcendent symbology not a language. Or some such thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T07:26:46-08:00","id":67888,"title":"","content":"Given that we're getting the Fallen World Chronicles, High Speech may, in fact, be completely different soon. So its hard to say. <br /> <br /> Even if we go by old rules, however? High Speech wasn't used to communicate - its not enough of a language (or enough known about said language) to make communication possible. And Tower of Babel just hinders communication, preventing people from finding a common tongue or understanding each other. High Speech isn't meant to communicate in that fashion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T13:04:49-08:00","id":68024,"title":"","content":"I'd allow it, it's cool. As previously said, it won't stop a spell, but it could imped either chanting in high speech (which adds 2 dice) or more interestingly verbal rote factors (which probably add +1 to the effect of the spell if it connects).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}